&lt;p&gt;Actively seeks ways to improve quality and workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to learn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to promote a positive Team environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
