&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take initiative and ownership of projects/assignments with attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accept and incorporate feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Punctual and consistent attendance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to speak, read, and write in English&lt;/p&gt;
