&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re seeking RNs who understand the pace, accountability, and impact of home health care:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
