&lt;p&gt;Our local office is currently hiring LPNs and RNs to work 1:1 with local pediatric and adult clients. &lt;strong&gt;We are hiring for full-time, part-time, and per diem opportunities in Lewisburg and surrounding towns.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
